{"definition_version":"acceptance-r1-a1","metric":"tokens","payload":{"activity":[],"activity_events":[],"demand_events":[],"destination_snapshots":[],"from":"2026-10-15T00:00:00Z","handoff_edges":[],"handoff_members":[],"intakes":[],"k2_closed_item":"Closed item: a queue item whose destination is this seat, counted once, with at least one successful terminal transition inside the half-open window [from, to): state done (closure reason no-follow-on, handed_off_to, escalation, or none) or state handed-off. Excluded: canceled, denied, failed, blocked, unknown or unlisted states, and done with closure reason denied or canceled. Tokens per closed item = seat tokens in the window / closed items; zero closed items = no data.","k2_closed_items_with_insufficient_history":0,"k2_destination_rule":"K5: destination at the closing transition = the latest queue.created destinationSession or qitem.fallback_routed rerouteDestination at or before it. The current queue_items.destination_session (snapshot cutoff queue_items.ts_updated) is used only when the item's queue.created is in the event history and there is no reroute mark (fallback-routed: transition note, qitem.fallback_routed event, fallback-from: chain_of_record entry, or differing stored snapshots). A reroute mark without a reroute event, or a creation outside the history, is insufficient history: the item counts for no seat and is listed under closed items with insufficient history.","k2_insufficient_history_members":[],"kind":"tokens","link_rates":[{"discovered":1,"harness":"codex","linked":1,"status":"ok"}],"links":[{"evidence":["events:1"],"harness":"codex","native_session":"synthetic-33-session","rig":"probe-rig","seat":"synthetic-seat","status":"linked"}],"m1_by_seat":[],"m1_yield":null,"m2_pairs":[],"m2_return_rate":null,"m3_chains":0,"m3_paths":[],"m3_rework_chains":0,"m3_rework_members":[],"m3_rework_proportion":"no data","m3_unknown_chains":0,"m3_unknown_members":[],"m4_impact":"insufficient data: a valid skill comparison needs the same role with and without the skill and at least five closed items on each side","mission_ambiguous_by_reason":{},"mission_by_seat":[],"mission_definition":"Mission attribution (K3/K5): a usage record gets the mission of the items its seat has in progress at that instant. An item is the seat's when its K5 destination then is the seat; the actor is never the destination. Missions are the item's mission: tags as set at creation. Every applicable ambiguity reason is recorded; the primary reason is the first that applies in this fixed order: insufficient history > detectable tag change > conflicting missions. Only the primary reason is counted in the ambiguous shares, so the shares sum exactly to the ambiguous band; secondary reasons are evidence only and overlap.","mission_records":[],"mission_tokens":{},"nonreturn_handoffs":[],"openrig_sources":[{"bytes":12288,"path":"/home/sam/code/dendro/goals/tool-loop-source-trace/baseline-probe/sources/openrig.sqlite","revision":"3298c538bb447c139010e664399e5c01ce6fa64f4a68c732c6151dbf5336c002","source_id":"openrig\n/home/sam/code/dendro/goals/tool-loop-source-trace/baseline-probe/sources/openrig.sqlite\n"}],"outcome_coverage":[{"harness":"claude","sources_read":0,"sources_total":0,"status":"not read","unit":"tool_call","unknowns":{"input":0,"linkage":0,"outcome":0,"timestamp":0}},{"harness":"pi","sources_read":0,"sources_total":0,"status":"not read","unit":"tool_call","unknowns":{"input":0,"linkage":0,"outcome":0,"timestamp":0}},{"harness":"codex","sources_read":0,"sources_total":1,"status":"not read","unit":"tool_call","unknowns":{"input":null,"linkage":null,"outcome":null,"timestamp":null}},{"harness":"codex","sources_read":1,"sources_total":1,"status":"read","unit":"command_execution","unknowns":{"input":0,"linkage":0,"outcome":0,"timestamp":0}}],"outcome_coverage_exclusions":{"unresolved_sources":0},"pair_medians":[],"product":"AI Fleet Intelligence","reasoning_rule":"reasoning is part of output, shown s